unch-bound W1 (1.73x). Becomes best-so-far / parent for next candidate.\", \"cumulative_evaluations\": 1, \"skill_usage\": {\"KernelWiki\": \"not-used (A800 sm_80 Ampere; KernelWiki covers Hopper/Blackwell only, out of scope)\"}, \"notes\": \"W1 (1.73x) lags others, consistent with launch-overhead + fp32-scratch pass tax on the small L2-resident workload -> motivates c002 (B1 memset+fused finalize, fewer bytes) and later a bf16-direct probe (c003) for the L2-resident regime. Correctness margin comfortable (99% matched-ratio gate met; max_abs 0.25 on <=1% tail expected from bf16 rounding vs non-deterministic reference).\"}\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":34893,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0fdaaead-f771-484d-aa35-540bb3e841d3","uuid":"78ebe3be-b141-424e-a11f-7453a80f40ba","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:10:51.174Z"}
