{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-ede165eb-c625-4fd7-adf5-e3e23407ea14","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Claude-Opus-4.8","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K9BSPhHFRcZYMyknEpzpXG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> candidates.jsonl <<'EOF'\n{\"candidate\": \"c002\", \"parent\": \"c001\", \"source_sha256\": \"d2531c61d557f5364eaf8a25ab3d32ca5fee4e0f65b23e522d5775f16779c1c4\", \"phase\": \"B\", \"hypothesis\": \"H4: full-row scatter (grid (N,), one int64 idx load per source row amortized over NUM_H=3 hidden tiles via tl.static_range) reduces redundant idx loads 3x and improves accumulator/L2 locality vs c001's tiled (N,cdiv(H,BLOCK_H)) scatter. Only the scatter kernel tiling/grid changed vs c001; init/finalize and BLOCK_H=1024/num_warps=4 identical.\", \"config\": {\"form\": \"B0-fp32-scratch-fullrow-scatter\", \"kernels\": 3, \"BLOCK_H\": 1024, \"NUM_H\": 3, \"num_warps\": 4, \"grid_scatter\": \"(N,)\", \"grid_init_finalize\": \"(M, cdiv(H,BLOCK_H))\"}, \"validation\": {\"pre_checks\": [\"fresh-output-and-buf\", \"full-M-row-init\", \"fp32-accumulate-round-once\", \"int64-row-offsets\", \"hidden-tail-mask\", \"triton-only-compute\"], \"correctness\": \"pass\", \"per_workload_pass\": {\"ada14c03\": true, \"8c5c94b5\": true, \"b61ee9a7\": true, \"2c1d8396\": true, \"8b677344\": true}}, \"results\": {\"per_workload_speedup\": {\"ada14c03\": 1.6958, \"8c5c94b5\": 2.0387, \"b61ee9a7\": 2.0056, \"2c1d8396\": 1.9236, \"8b677344\": 1.9211}, \"per_workload_ms\": {\"ada14c03\": 0.234123, \"8c5c94b5\": 2.622951, \"b61ee9a7\": 1.303412, \"2c1d8396\": 0.651522, \"8b677344\": 0.654482}, \"geomean_speedup\": 1.9130, \"arithmetic_mean_speedup\": 1.9170}, \"decision\": \"reject-for-branching\", \"decision_reason\": \"Correct on all 5 but geomean 1.9130x < c001 1.9287x (regression ~0.8%); slightly slower on every workload (W1 1.696 vs 1.730, W2 2.039 vs 2.047, W3 2.006 vs 2.016). Full-row scatter cut the program count 3x (e.g. W2 65536 vs 196608