den-tail-mask\", \"triton-only-compute\"], \"correctness\": \"pass\", \"per_workload_pass\": {\"ada14c03\": true, \"8c5c94b5\": true, \"b61ee9a7\": true, \"2c1d8396\": true, \"8b677344\": true}}, \"results\": {\"per_workload_speedup\": {\"ada14c03\": 1.7303521854148776, \"8c5c94b5\": 2.0466261869445144, \"b61ee9a7\": 2.015717357451325, \"2c1d8396\": 1.9254939797537822, \"8b677344\": 1.9418560293075147}, \"per_workload_ms\": {\"ada14c03\": 0.229453, \"8c5c94b5\": 2.6127485, \"b61ee9a7\": 1.2968465, \"2c1d8396\": 0.650887, \"8b677344\": 0.647479}, \"geomean_speedup\": 1.9287341591885712, \"arithmetic_mean_speedup\": 1.9320091477744028}, \"decision\": \"accept\", \"decision_reason\": \"Correct on all 5 workloads; geomean 1.929x >> 1.0. Confirms H1 (native fp32 atomics beat torch bf16 CAS even with +~300MB init/finalize passes). Largest gains on BW/L2-bound W2/W3 (~2.05x), smallest on launch-bound W1 (1.73x). Becomes best-so-far / parent for next candidate.\", \"cumulative_evaluations\": 1, \"skill_usage\": {\"KernelWiki\": \"not-used (A800 sm_80 Ampere; KernelWiki covers Hopper/Blackwell only, out of scope)\"}, \"notes\": \"W1 (1.73x) lags others, consistent with launch-overhead + fp32-scratch pass tax on the small L2-resident workload -> motivates c002 (B1 memset+fused finalize, fewer bytes) and later a bf16-direct probe (c003) for the L2-resident regime. Correctness margin comfortable (99% matched-ratio gate met; max_abs 0.25 on <=1% tail expected from bf16 rounding vs non-deterministic reference).\"}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":1,"newStart":1,"newLines":2,"lines":[" {\"candidate\": \"c001\", \"parent\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"2c9157cc2aee92732b31461cf6c280a3d639b74119a0540ceddbab2065f0070b\", \"phase\": \"A\", \"hypothesis\": \"Option B0: fp32-scratch accumulator + native red.global.add.f32 atomics beats torch bf16 CAS index_add_; fp32 accumulate + round once stays within tolerance and is >= as accurate as reference.\", \"config\": {\"form\": \"B0-fp32-scratch\", \"kernels\": 3, \"BLOCK_H\": 1024, \"num_warps\": 4, \"grid_scatter\": \"(N, cdiv(H,BLOCK_H))\", \"grid_init_finalize\": \"(M, cdiv(H,BLOCK_H))\"}, \"validation\": {\"pre_checks\": [\"fresh-output-and-buf\", \"full-M-row-init\", \"fp32-accumulate-round-once\", \"int64-row-offsets\", \"hidden-tail-mask\", \"triton-only-compute\"], \"correctness\": \"pass\", \"per_workload_pass\": {\"ada14c03\": true, \"8c5c94b5\": true, \"b61ee9a7\": true, \"2c1d8396\": true, \"8b677344\": true}}, \"results\": {\"per_workload_speedup\": {\"ada14c03\": 1.7303521854148776, \"8c5c94b5\": 2.0466261869445144, \"b61ee9a7\": 2.015717357451325, \"2c1d8396\": 1.9254939797537822, \"8b677344\": 1.9418560293075147}, \"per_workload_ms\": {\"ada14c03\": 0.229453, \"8c5c94b5\": 2.6127485, \"b61ee9a7\": 1.2968465, \"2c1d8396\": 0.650887, \"8b677344\": 0.647479}, \"geomean_speedup\": 1.9287341591885712, \"arithmetic_mean_speedup\": 1.9320091477744028}, \"decision\": \"accept\", \"decision_reason\": \"Correct on all 5 workloads; geomean 1.929x >> 1.0. Confirms H1 (native fp32 atomics beat torch bf16 CAS even with +~300MB init/finalize passes). Largest gains on BW/L2-bound W2/W3 (~2.05x), smallest on launch-bound W1 (1.73x). Becomes best-so-far / parent for next candidate.\", \"cumulative_evaluations\": 1, \"skill_usage\": {\"KernelWiki\": \"not-used (A800 sm_80 Ampere; KernelWiki covers Hopper/Blackwell only, out of scope)\"}, \"notes\": \"W1 (1.73x) lags others, consistent with launch-overhead + fp32-scratch pass tax on the small L2-resident workload -> motivates c002 (B1 memset+fused finalize, fewer bytes) and later a bf16-direct probe (c003) for the L2-resident regime. Correctness margin comfortable (99% matched-ratio gate met; max_abs 0.25 on <=1% tail expected from bf16 rounding vs non-deterministic reference).\"}","+{\"candidate\": \"c002\", \"parent\": \"c001\", \"source_sha256\": \"d2531c61d557f5364eaf8a25ab3d32ca5fee4e0f65b23e522d5775f16779c1c4\", \"phase\": \"B\", \"hypo