ligible vs 8*M*H*2 src read, so amortizing it gained nothing; occupancy is the lever. Next: keep c001's tiled scatter and sweep occupancy knobs -> c003 tries num_warps=8 (more warps/program to hide atomic+load latency) on the exact c001 form.\"}"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
